<title>UK: Nationwide December house price index - table.</title>
<headline>Nationwide December house price index - table.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nationwide Building Society released the following UK house price data -</p>
<p>    HOUSE PRICES (index base Q1 1983-100)  Dec    Nov    Dec 95</p>
<p>    Monthly index (s/adj)		     110.1  110.4   101.5</p>
<p>    Monthly change (s/adj, in pct)	   -0.3   1.0     -0.1</p>
<p>    Annual change (not s/adj, in pct)	 8.5   8.8     -2.5</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
